# Installed to ~/.local/share/cursor-mcp/mcp.env (chmod 600).
# One KEY=VALUE per line. No quotes, no export, no shell expansion.
# Comments and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Populated by install.sh --migrate from inline values in mcp.json:
#   - stdio server "env" keys keep their original names (e.g. MY_API_KEY)
#   - remote server "headers" become MCP_<SERVER>_<HEADER> (e.g. MCP_MY_API_X_API_KEY)
#
# Example (delete and replace after migrate):
# MY_API_KEY=
# MCP_MY_REMOTE_SERVER_AUTHORIZATION=
